{"text":"If you can't get up and walk 30 feet, pick up the telephone. I've done it. It's an amazing thing. You pick up the phone and you go, hey. They're like, hey, what's the matter? They're like, no, I'm just replying to your email. Wanted to tell you what I thought. What? And people who tell me, but I need a paper trail, have the conversation, hang up and say, just to confirm what we talked about, boom, there's your paper trail. The reason we get so many emails is because we reply to them all. And 12 emails are sent and then somebody misunderstands something and somebody gets angry and then you have to pick up the phone and deal with it anyway. Do it at the beginning. Quicker, easier, better. Give your time and give your energy.","words":[{"text":"If","start":0.46,"end":0.78},{"text":"you","start":0.78,"end":0.92},{"text":"can't","start":0.92,"end":1.24},{"text":"get","start":1.24,"end":1.32},{"text":"up","start":1.32,"end":1.48},{"text":"and","start":1.48,"end":1.6},{"text":"walk","start":1.6,"end":1.8},{"text":"30","start":1.8,"end":2.02},{"text":"feet","start":2.02,"end":2.22,"punct":","},{"text":"pick","start":2.42,"end":2.48},{"text":"up","start":2.48,"end":2.58},{"text":"the","start":2.58,"end":2.7},{"text":"telephone","start":2.7,"end":3.04,"punct":"."},{"text":"I've","start":3.6,"end":3.88},{"text":"done","start":3.88,"end":4.02},{"text":"it","start":4.02,"end":4.2,"punct":"."},{"text":"It's","start":4.28,"end":4.36},{"text":"an","start":4.36,"end":4.46},{"text":"amazing","start":4.46,"end":4.7},{"text":"thing","start":4.7,"end":4.96,"punct":"."},{"text":"You","start":5.08,"end":5.08},{"text":"pick","start":5.08,"end":5.2},{"text":"up","start":5.2,"end":5.3},{"text":"the","start":5.3,"end":5.4},{"text":"phone","start":5.4,"end":5.54},{"text":"and","start":5.54,"end":5.66},{"text":"you","start":5.66,"end":5.7},{"text":"go","start":5.7,"end":5.86,"punct":","},{"text":"hey","start":6.4,"end":6.7,"punct":"."},{"text":"They're","start":7.22,"end":7.36},{"text"